  },
  "dashboardMetadata": {
    "name": "Google ADK — GenAI Metrics & Token Analytics (OpenTelemetry)",
    "shared": true,
    "preset": false,
    "tags": [
      "google-adk",
      "genai",
      "opentelemetry",
      "llm-observability"
    ],
    "DynamicFilters": {
      "filters": [
        "CUSTOM_DIMENSION:gen_ai.request.model",
        "CUSTOM_DIMENSION:gen_ai.agent.name",
        "CUSTOM_DIMENSION:gen_ai.tool.name"
      ]
    }
  },
  "tiles": [
    {
      "name": "Markdown",
      "tileType": "MARKDOWN",
      "configured": true,
      "bounds": {
        "top": 0,
        "left": 0,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 114
      },
      " tileFilter": {},
      "markdown": "## Google ADK Enterprise Observability — OpenTelemetry GenAI Metrics (Dynatrace)\nVisualizes all **7 native ADK OpenTelemetry GenAI Histogram Metrics** (`gen_ai.client.token.usage`, `gen_ai.client.operation.duration`, `gen_ai.execute_tool.duration`, `gen_ai.invoke_agent.duration`, `gen_ai.invoke_agent.inference_calls`, `gen_ai.invoke_agent.tool_calls`, `gen_ai.invoke_workflow.duration`) ingested directly via Dynatrace OTLP HTTP API (`/api/v2/otlp/v1/metrics`) with credentials fetched at runtime from **Google Cloud Secret Manager**."
    },
    {
      "name": "1. GenAI Token Usage by Token Type & Model (gen_ai.client.token.usage)",
      "tileType": "DATA_EXPLORER",
      "configured": true,
      "bounds": {
        "top": 114,
        "left": 0,
        "width": 855,
        "height": 304
      },
      "tileFilter": {},
      "customName": "1. GenAI Token Usage by Token Type & Model (gen_ai.client.token.usage)",
      "queries": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "metric": "gen_ai.client.token.usage",
          "spaceAggregation": "SUM",
          "timeAggregation": "DEFAULT",
          "splitBy": [
            "gen_ai.token.type",
            "gen_ai.request.model"
          ],
          "enabled": true
        }
      ],
      "visualConfig": {
        "type": "GRAPH_CHART",
        "global": {},
        "rules": [
          {
            "matcher": "A:",
            "properties": {
              "seriesType": "COLUMN"
            },
            "seriesOverrides": []
          }
        ],
        "axes": {
          "xAxis": {
            "visible": true
          },
          "yAxes": [
            {
              "label": "Tokens",
              "visible": true,
              "min": "AUTO",
              "max": "AUTO",
              "position": "LEFT",
              "queryIds": ["A"],
              "defaultAxis": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
